{
 "rc": {
  "i18n": {
   "zh-CN": {
    "title": "近一个月",
    "sub": "所有事项 · 每天达标了几件",
    "sToday": "今天",
    "sDays": "有记录",
    "sHits": "达标",
    "uDay": " 天",
    "uTime": " 次",
    "masked": "已隐藏",
    "addFirst": "添加第一件要坚持的事"
   },
   "en-US": {
    "title": "Last 35 days",
    "sub": "All habits · met per day",
    "sToday": "Today",
    "sDays": "Active",
    "sHits": "Met",
    "uDay": " days",
    "uTime": " times",
    "masked": "Hidden",
    "addFirst": "Add the first habit to keep"
   }
  },
  "cells": [
   {
    "id": "bg",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "0pt",
    "y": "0pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}",
    "h": "{parent.h}",
    "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
   },
   {
    "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。⚠️ 色值恒 #2E9E6B|#45C793,**不跟事项的调色板走** —— 这颗点答的是「这是 checkin 的卡」,不是「这件事是紫色的」;跟着 pal 变会让同一个包在盘上看着像六个源。",
    "id": "dot",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "{title.y}+({title.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "title",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "23pt",
    "y": "12pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-37pt-88pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.title}",
    "fontSize": "13pt",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "typeface": "System-Bold"
   },
   {
    "_note": "卡名行最右那一格恒有内容(card-design-system §3 + §5):常态渲 MM-DD 日期锚(零网络包,锚答的是「这一屏说的是哪天」);打码态改渲状态标记 —— 打码 ≠ 空态,空态是 `--`/空槽加事实陈述,打码是主动语态的一句状态,而那一刻这张卡上没有任何随时间变的可见量、锚零信息量。⚠️ 与网格下方那对坐标轴刻度**刻意重复右端那个日期**:轴读作刻度、右上角读作时间戳,两者在读者那里不是同一件事,而少了右上角这一格,这张卡在一屏 20 张卡里就是唯一空着右上角的那张。",
    "id": "mk",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-94pt",
    "y": "15pt",
    "w": "80pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "alignmentH": "2",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${@i18n.masked},findNotEmpty::(${atLbl},--))]",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
   },
   {
    "id": "sub",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "34pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-144pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.sub}",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "_note": "日期锚(标准 §4.4)。35 格自己不带任何日期,而桌面小组件的封面缓存 key 不含时间维度 —— 不写窗口起止,一张停在上个月的卡和刚渲的一模一样。",
    "id": "rng",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-126pt",
    "y": "35pt",
    "w": "112pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${mStartLbl},--)] – $[findNotEmpty::(${mEndLbl},--)]",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "alignmentH": "2"
   },
